# The mecha module a prerelease published from this branch pins (see
# workflows/prerelease-gcp.yml): mecha-fork's host launch synced onto upstream mecha
# 0.22.0 (feat/host-launch-0.17, mecha-fork#22) with the preset-enforcing imgproxy stand-in (mecha-fork#24), the airlock door (#26) and a provider's sign-in adopting the guest it starts from (mecha-fork#28), a door caller naming the sink's Idempotency-Key (#30) and a guest's token refresh (#31), published by workflows/prerelease-mecha.yml.
MECHA_V=0.22.0-host.7
# The omnishell module and runtime it pins: omnishell-fork line/0.23.0-fork, upstream
# omnishell 0.23.0 with line/0.20.3 (fork.18) carried onto it (omnishell-fork#27) and
# the speculation-rules split upstream's shell no longer has (omnishell-fork#29),
